    "content": "The baseline specification is ready for review: [spec.md](/work/specs/001-bookmark-manager/spec.md).\n\nIt defines a single-user bookmark manager with:\n\n- Manual bookmark creation\n- Tags, search, filtering, and sorting\n- Favorites and archiving\n- Editing and confirmed deletion\n- Duplicate URL detection\n- Persistence for at least 5,000 bookmarks\n\nAccounts, sharing, browser import/export, cross-device sync, folders, and automatic page metadata are currently out of scope.\n\nThe quality checklist passed all items: [requirements.md](/work/specs/001-bookmark-manager/checklists/requirements.md).\n\nPlease approve the specification or tell me what you’d like changed. I’ll wait for approval before creating the implementation plan.",
