    "round": 2,
    "role": "maker",
    "content": "The implementation plan is ready for review: [plan.md](/work/specs/001-bookmark-manager/plan.md).\n\nKey choices:\n\n- React 19 and TypeScript for the interface\n- Express 5 serving the app and JSON API\n- SQLite persistence through `better-sqlite3`\n- Shared validation with Zod\n- WCAG 2.2 AA accessibility target\n- Vitest, component tests, API tests, and Playwright browser tests\n- One production process on `0.0.0.0:4000`\n- Automatic title retrieval remains deferred for a later feature\n\nSupporting design artifacts:\n\n- [Research decisions](/work/specs/001-bookmark-manager/research.md)\n- [Data model](/work/specs/001-bookmark-manager/data-model.md)\n- [API contract](/work/specs/001-bookmark-manager/contracts/openapi.yaml)\n- [Validation quickstart](/work/specs/001-bookmark-manager/quickstart.md)\n\nThe API contract is valid YAML, all planning questions are resolved, and the design remains within the approved specification. No code or task breakdown has been created yet.\n\nPlease approve the plan or request changes. Once approved, I’ll generate the dependency-ordered implementation tasks.",
